Dry your tears, little diaper baby.

27
00:02:10,780 --> 00:02:12,120
We're moving out now.

28
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:13,640
You get to carry my stuff.

29
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:14,120
Huh?

30
00:02:14,300 --> 00:02:17,300
They're supposed to be his allies, not his personal Sherpas.

31
00:02:17,540 --> 00:02:19,520
Yay! I love toting things!

32
00:02:19,700 --> 00:02:21,220
This'll be fun, Maz, right?

33
00:02:21,340 --> 00:02:24,620
You know, this whole ordeal has taught me a very valuable lesson.

34
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:26,300
Our levels are leagues apart.

35
00:02:26,820 --> 00:02:28,120
Anyone with eyes could see that.

36
00:02:28,940 --> 00:02:29,640
That's why...

37
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:32,900
I want to meet your part-time apprentice!

38
00:02:33,260 --> 00:02:35,380
While remaining a full-time bag boy, of course!

39
00:02:35,580 --> 00:02:36,020
Please!

40
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:39,040
Just carry my things and don't embarrass me, or yourself.

41
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:42,480
Your benevolence knows no bounds!

42
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:44,180
Thank you for all your help, Seiya!

43
00:02:44,420 --> 00:02:44,960
You idiot!

44
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:46,740
You referred to him as Master!

45
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:47,440
It doesn't matter what you're talking about.

46
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:51,080
Not my ideal kind of party, but I guess things could have turned out a lot worse.

47
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:55,680
This might seem kind of out of the blue, but there's a place I'd really like to take you to, Master.

48
00:02:55,980 --> 00:02:58,880
Oh! I bet you're talking about Dragon's Den, aren't you?

49
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:00,520
Why would we go there?

50
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:09,000
According to Nagashi Village lore, 16 years ago, a dragon descended from the heavens carrying two babies, Elulu and myself.

51
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:14,720
Legend says we're to team up with a hero and defend Gea Bronde from a terrible evil.

52
00:03:15,220 --> 00:03:17,780
It's said we need to break the seal in the dragon's den.

53
00:03:18,220 --> 00:03:21,720
Only then will we be granted a mighty weapon to aid in our quest.

54
00:03:21,860 --> 00:03:22,140
Huh?

55
00:03:22,140 --> 00:03:24,620
Oh, Seiya loves a mighty weapon!

56
00:03:24,940 --> 00:03:29,960
Yeah, but I'm already packing three enhanced platinum swords thanks to your premature balding issues.

57
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:32,120
We can discuss your hair hoarding later.

58
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:36,020
Besides, just when you think you have the very best, something even better comes along.

59
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:38,500
I think we should check this thing out for ourselves.

60
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:39,180
Forget it.

61
00:03:39,180 --> 00:03:42,700
We need to make a major pit stop before we go anywhere.

62
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,900
You're kidding me. Seriously.

63
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:50,220
Whoa! We're really in the world where gods live?

64
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:52,200
Whoa! This is insane!

65
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:56,400
They have rings floating over their heads! Are they angels?

66
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:59,020
Would it be okay if we go exploring?

67
00:03:59,320 --> 00:04:01,340
Don't be dumb. We came here to train.

68
00:04:02,100 --> 00:04:03,720
I don't see him anywhere.

69
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:10,660
I think someone so big and bulky would be a lot easier to spot.

70
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,220
What's with the apron?

71
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:18,060
Care to tell us what the hell you're doing?

72
00:04:18,280 --> 00:04:19,520
Oh, hey there, Seiya.

73
00:04:19,820 --> 00:04:23,800
Not sure what business you could possibly have with a retired swordsman such as myself.

74
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:25,600
I mean, blades are dangerous.

75
00:04:25,820 --> 00:04:27,840
There's a good chance I'd bleed out if I got caught.

76
00:04:27,960 --> 00:04:30,000
The divine blade is afraid of swords now?

77
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:31,500
Great work, Seiya.

78
00:04:31,500 --> 00:04:35,660
But, not to worry, I've been keeping busy by learning how to bake.

79
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:37,660
Here's a cake I just finished. You want a bite?

80
00:04:38,180 --> 00:04:39,520
Nah, bro. That's gross.

81
00:04:39,900 --> 00:04:41,460
How can you know without tasting?

82
00:04:41,860 --> 00:04:43,340
I worked so hard on this.

83
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:45,920
I'll bet you'll have a bite.

84
00:04:46,060 --> 00:04:49,360
A hard pass. It looks like it tastes like sweat and sad.

85
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:50,320
How would I even bake that?

86
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:51,440
I'm going to need you to focus.

87
00:04:52,280 --> 00:04:54,360
Look, I didn't come here to dump on your lame hobbies.

88
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:57,240
Tell me, you still have your day job, don't you?

89
00:04:57,620 --> 00:04:58,640
That should come first.

90
00:04:58,900 --> 00:05:00,480
What's my day job?

91
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:02,600
This, obviously.

92
00:05:03,020 --> 00:05:04,980
That's not my day job! It's a nightmare!

93
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:05,880
Get that thing away from me!

94
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:07,780
This guy seems a little unstable.

95
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:12,080
Relax, Pee Pants. I won't be the one you train this time around. He will.

96
00:05:12,580 --> 00:05:16,420
Look at that. Seiya's almost being what some would call considerate.

97
00:05:16,580 --> 00:05:18,780
I can't entrust my bags to a weakling.

98
00:05:19,160 --> 00:05:20,920
My equipment would be ganked for sure.

99
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:22,680
Got yourself an apprentice, did you?

100
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:25,160
Mind if I see your abilities?

101
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,920
Sure, knock yourself out.

102
00:05:29,700 --> 00:05:32,840
You weren't using that pesky fake-out skill just now, were you?

103
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:34,400
I'm afraid I wasn't.

104
00:05:35,460 --> 00:05:37,940
Kid, you're in for some intense training!

105
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:41,460
I'll run you so hard your muscles will have muscles, little guy!

106
00:05:41,460 --> 00:05:45,020
What is your deal, man? I think the chains on your mood swing just snapped!

107
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:47,600
Back to normal after he sees the outclass' mosh?

108
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:50,380
Man on the outside and fragile flower on the inside.

109
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,000
Sweet if it wasn't so sad.

110
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:56,980
So, you're asking me to teach this young one in the art of flame magic, correct?

111
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,540
I'd greatly appreciate it if you could.

112
00:05:59,840 --> 00:06:03,440
It's our divine duty to support humans attempting to save their worlds.

113
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,340
I'd be delighted to help you.

114
00:06:05,340 --> 00:06:10,620
Um, thank you. My name is Ailulu. It's an honor to make your acquaintance!

115
00:06:10,900 --> 00:06:13,960
Such pretty red hair. Much like mine.

116
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:17,900
Let's try and calm those nerves down. Yes?

117
00:06:19,380 --> 00:06:21,440
Okay, that takes care of those two.

118
00:06:21,880 --> 00:06:24,720
All that's left to do now is to find someone who can train me.

119
00:06:25,060 --> 00:06:28,480
I was wondering how long it'd take to bring it around back to him.

120
00:06:30,740 --> 00:06:31,800
I'm so sorry!

121
00:06:31,820 --> 00:06:32,440
Hey, Blondie!

122
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:34,340
You need to watch where you're walking.

123
00:06:34,340 --> 00:06:37,820
Even a scrub goddess like you should be able to manage that.

124
00:06:38,100 --> 00:06:41,440
Altery! Please forgive me! It won't ever happen again! You have my word!

125
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:43,980
That reminds me.

126
00:06:44,260 --> 00:06:47,300
You got stuck bailing out a world with an S-class rank, didn't you?

127
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:51,120
That's pretty ambitious for someone who can't even put one foot in front of the other.

128
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:54,040
Well, you might have a point. I mean...

129
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:57,420
Good thing your bouncy plumpers more than make up for your faults.

130
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,680
And you've got some big faults.

131
00:06:59,700 --> 00:07:02,420
Please stop! I'm not a piece of fruit, you know!

132
00:07:02,420 --> 00:07:04,840
All right. I guess I'll let you off the hook.

133
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:07,040
But be more careful from now on.

134
00:07:08,520 --> 00:07:09,880
I'm a little violated.

135
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:12,860
You get picked on in this world, huh?

136
00:07:12,880 --> 00:07:15,640
I do not! Valkyrie just treats everyone like that!

137
00:07:15,940 --> 00:07:20,360
I gotta say, I sense some serious power coming from that exhibitionist.

138
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:24,020
Please don't even think it. That was Valkyrie, the goddess of destruction.

139
00:07:25,020 --> 00:07:27,900
She's the most fearsome goddess in the unified divine realm.

140
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,680
There's no way she'd train you.

141
00:07:30,220 --> 00:07:33,280
For a human, talking to her is enough to risk instant annihilation.

142
00:07:33,440 --> 00:07:35,640
Hey, Chainkini. Train me.

143
00:07:35,980 --> 00:07:39,360
I know you're not talking to me in that tone.

144
00:07:39,580 --> 00:07:42,280
The fact that you're a hero won't stop me from tearing you apart!

145
00:07:42,660 --> 00:07:44,140
Yeah, I wish you would.

146
00:07:44,140 --> 00:07:45,380
Please lock it up, Saiya!

147
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:47,540
How about you apologize and we can be on our way!

148
00:07:48,280 --> 00:07:50,720
Apology? But what would be the point of that?

149
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:53,520
Since I'm gonna scatter his remains across the entire realm!

150
00:07:53,900 --> 00:07:55,080
No! Have mercy!

151
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:56,760
Oh, pardon me!

152
00:07:57,900 --> 00:07:58,380
Arya!

153
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:00,740
Valkyrie, please.

154
00:08:00,960 --> 00:08:03,100
I bid you stand down and refrain from fighting.

155
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:04,220
As if I would!

156
00:08:04,500 --> 00:08:07,980
This level of insolence deserves a punishment equal to a thousand deaths!

157
00:08:07,980 --> 00:08:13,080
The mortal you keep threatening is a special hero who was summoned to save an S-class world in the utmost peril.

158
00:08:13,340 --> 00:08:15,560
Please put your anger aside and let this man be.

159
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:19,320
In deference to myself, the high-ranking goddess Arya Doha.

160
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,280
Please, unhand him.

161
00:08:23,500 --> 00:08:27,120
If you're gonna make a big scene about it, I'll let him go.

162
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:31,860
But in return, I get to give those chest muumus a nice massage sometime.

163
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,480
Uh, okay.

164
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:39,920
That was a whole new level of senseless, even for you!

165
00:08:40,340 --> 00:08:41,940
Saiya, you really are something else.

166
00:08:42,020 --> 00:08:42,980
Hey, I got a question.

167
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:45,840
Do you talk smack to everyone, or am I special?

168
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:48,080
I meant no offense.

169
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:52,960
So, rumor has it you're on the hunt for a new divine trainer.

170
00:08:53,520 --> 00:08:55,420
I may know of a candidate if you're interested.

171
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:59,300
Meet the goddess of war, Adanella.

172
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:03,140
In terms of combat, she's a little more advanced than Circeus is.

173
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:05,900
Ah, it's nice to meet you, Adanella.

174
00:09:07,640 --> 00:09:11,220
Well then, if you're not too busy, would you mind training up this hero?

175
00:09:12,500 --> 00:09:13,460
D-train?

176
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:18,880
You want me to train a human?

177
00:09:19,300 --> 00:09:20,040
You're kidding.

178
00:09:21,100 --> 00:09:24,420
I'm gonna need to see some goddess ID because this girl is...

179
00:09:24,420 --> 00:09:26,700
Disgusting. Disgusting as hell.

180
00:09:26,740 --> 00:09:29,600
You're not supposed to say it out loud, even if we're all thinking it!

181
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:33,840
Hey, you know, I find some small joy in training.

182
00:09:34,220 --> 00:09:35,560
Sure, I'll train the human.

183
00:09:38,020 --> 00:09:40,900
I see you were able to follow my movements just now.

184
00:09:41,180 --> 00:09:43,940
I wonder if your mind is as sharp as your sight.

185
00:09:44,660 --> 00:09:49,580
Will you be able to learn what I have to teach and master the divine speed skill, Eternal Sword?

186
00:09:49,580 --> 00:09:53,960
Or will your body give out and leave you sobbing like a spanked baby?

187
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:57,460
I did not sign up for this nightmare fuel.

188
00:09:57,760 --> 00:09:59,000
Maybe we should look at other options.

189
00:09:59,020 --> 00:09:59,860
Let's give it a shot.

190
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:00,840
Give it a what?!

191
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:03,280
How is this the one thing he's not cautious about?!

192
00:10:03,280 --> 00:10:05,840
He made this Eternal Sword move sound pretty legit.

193
00:10:07,020 --> 00:10:08,820
It's Eternal Sword, actually.

194
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:11,160
Blah, blah, blah. Let's do this.

195
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:13,380
I... I like your style.

196
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,960
Thanks, Aria. I'm in your debt again.

197
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:21,540
It's fine. I'm happy I could be of some help.

198
00:10:23,020 --> 00:10:24,860
That's it. Now one more time.

199
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:25,300
Okay!

200
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:29,880
They're getting a lot better than I expected.

201
00:10:30,820 --> 00:10:34,220
And I know I don't have to worry about Aylulu since she's with Hestika.

202
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:37,120
My only concern is getting this food to Seiya.

203
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:40,560
Huh? Shouldn't you be somewhere training a hero?

204
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:43,160
I'm... taking a break right now.

205
00:10:43,680 --> 00:10:46,860
Seiya is still... practicing on his own, though.

206
00:10:47,220 --> 00:10:49,500
How's he handling all that Eternal Sword stuff?

207
00:10:49,880 --> 00:10:51,480
He's truly amazing.

208
00:10:51,900 --> 00:10:54,200
Unlike any hero I've ever encountered before.

209
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,660
And... I think that...

210
00:10:56,660 --> 00:10:57,540
You think what?

211
00:10:58,680 --> 00:11:01,180
Nice! Let's dial back the freak face!

212
00:11:01,380 --> 00:11:03,960
I... just remembered something that happened in training.

213
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:06,440
Seiya, he really amused me.

214
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:09,600
Hey, grunge bucket. Break's over. Let's go.

215
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:12,200
It's right. I'm on my way.

216
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:18,200
I forgot to give him his food!

217
00:11:19,900 --> 00:11:21,840
I hope everyone's staying productive.

218
00:11:23,740 --> 00:11:26,440
It's rare to see the pair of you share a meal in the cafeteria.

219
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,840
Shroomy here wanted some bro time.

220
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:31,120
I thought the least we could do was spin lunch together.

221
00:11:31,680 --> 00:11:34,660
He's been teaching me all about the kind of mindset he has when he's in a fight.

222
00:11:34,660 --> 00:11:37,260
Yeah. I'm kind of curious myself.

223
00:11:37,540 --> 00:11:39,940
Not now. Dark and dingy's waiting on me.

224
00:11:40,100 --> 00:11:41,520
Good talk! Thanks, Master!

225
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:44,580
Don't forget we're heading back to Gayabranday tomorrow!

226
00:11:44,580 --> 00:11:53,120
So, what were you going to say about that fighting mindset stuff or whatever it was?

227
00:11:54,260 --> 00:11:58,300
It more or less boiled down to doubt everyone and everything at all times.

228
00:11:58,760 --> 00:12:01,840
Even your close friends and family members may be trying to kill you.

229
00:12:02,260 --> 00:12:06,380
What a hysterical, paranoid, and delusional thing to fill an impressionable mind with.

230
00:12:06,380 --> 00:12:08,100
Oh, there was another thing he said.

231
00:12:08,540 --> 00:12:12,160
Remember, Mushroom, I suspect you just as much as everyone else.

232
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:14,420
Man, how cool is that?

233
00:12:14,560 --> 00:12:18,180
Great. Now the universe has one more disciple of cautionism.

234
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:24,460
Is that you, Adanella?

235
00:12:25,340 --> 00:12:27,240
It is! I don't believe it!

236
00:12:27,620 --> 00:12:29,260
Kudos to whoever did your makeover!

237
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:32,900
Well, truth is, I was embarrassed by how I looked before.

238
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:35,180
I want to look nice for Saya.

239
00:12:35,180 --> 00:12:38,640
Another enamored ditty bites the dust.

240
00:12:38,940 --> 00:12:41,460
If he'd slay demon lords like he slays goddesses, we'd be set!

241
00:12:42,460 --> 00:12:45,940
I hate to be a mother, but we're kind of on a time crunch.

242
00:12:46,340 --> 00:12:48,800
Could my hero pick up your special skill at a later date?

243
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:51,920
The Eternal Sword? He mastered that technique already.

244
00:12:52,260 --> 00:12:53,040
He what?

245
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:55,180
That human has a gift.

246
00:12:55,700 --> 00:12:59,020
Yes, the size of which is truly something to behold and acknowledge.

247
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:03,960
And, best of all, he can.

248
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:06,520
Keep up with me!

249
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:11,240
I'm not sure why. She makes me even more uncomfortable now.

250
00:13:13,420 --> 00:13:14,400
Thanks for everything!

251
00:13:15,020 --> 00:13:16,420
No, I should be thanking you.

252
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:19,960
With your help, I managed to put that berserker nightmare behind me!

253
00:13:20,420 --> 00:13:21,880
His level has risen dramatically.

254
00:13:22,420 --> 00:13:24,800
Could Cersei actually be a half-decent teacher?

255
00:13:24,800 --> 00:13:28,360
Hey, Alulu!

256
00:13:28,840 --> 00:13:30,540
Oh, hi guys!

257
00:13:30,760 --> 00:13:31,940
The hiatus is over!

258
00:13:32,420 --> 00:13:33,560
So are you ready to go?

259
00:13:33,940 --> 00:13:35,560
Because the sooner we head out, the better.

260
00:13:36,220 --> 00:13:37,760
Um, right!

261
00:13:37,760 --> 00:13:40,940
Hold on.

262
00:13:41,580 --> 00:13:44,160
Our stats are basically the same as they were on day one!

263
00:13:44,660 --> 00:13:45,020
Rista.

264
00:13:46,020 --> 00:13:47,240
A word, if you will.

265
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:49,600
Look, let's be blunt.

266
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:51,920
Flame magic eludes that girl.

267
00:13:52,440 --> 00:13:54,320
Oh, that can't be right.

268
00:13:54,460 --> 00:13:55,860
She's trying her little heart out.

269
00:13:56,820 --> 00:13:59,560
Magic depends largely upon the talent you're born with.

270
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:03,060
And sadly, that girl wasn't born with any talent at all.

271
00:14:03,060 --> 00:14:04,060
Aww.

272
00:14:11,780 --> 00:14:12,340
Seiya!

273
00:14:12,940 --> 00:14:14,680
Can we finally go now?

274
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:15,520
Sure.

275
00:14:15,980 --> 00:14:19,700
Once the creep queen shows, she said she had something she wanted to give me.

276
00:14:21,280 --> 00:14:21,880
Seiya!

277
00:14:25,460 --> 00:14:26,640
What the heck?

278
00:14:27,500 --> 00:14:28,560
Hi, Seiya.

279
00:14:29,100 --> 00:14:32,940
I've been doing some thinking, and I've decided to join your party.

280
00:14:32,940 --> 00:14:36,500
You better be talking birthdays over there, because this party only has room for one goddess!

281
00:14:37,100 --> 00:14:39,960
Well, if I can't be a teammate, then perhaps an escort?

282
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:42,380
I just want to be by your side.

283
00:14:42,780 --> 00:14:43,680
It's love!

284
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:44,720
I'm in a moment!

285
00:14:45,280 --> 00:14:45,680
Here.

286
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:47,880
This took me five hours to make.

287
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:50,280
I used my heart as the main ingredient.

288
00:14:51,040 --> 00:14:52,520
Please, eat every bite.

289
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:54,880
Uh-oh, goth goddess has it bad.

290
00:14:55,300 --> 00:14:55,880
Wait a sec.

291
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:57,080
Seiya hates cake.

292
00:14:57,520 --> 00:14:58,000
Grossness.

293
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:58,580
Cake sucks.

294
00:14:58,720 --> 00:14:59,060
Yes!

295
00:14:59,120 --> 00:15:00,020
I called it!

296
00:15:00,740 --> 00:15:03,560
Look, you're great at training, but you knew what this was.

297
00:15:03,700 --> 00:15:04,880
It's not me, it's you.

298
00:15:05,240 --> 00:15:06,800
And all cake can go straight to hell.

299
00:15:07,020 --> 00:15:07,300
Period.

300
00:15:07,660 --> 00:15:08,360
Sorry about you.

301
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:13,520
He really doesn't want it?

302
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:16,640
Hey, don't be so rude!

303
00:15:17,640 --> 00:15:21,080
Jerk, don't you know love-struck girls are super fragile?

304
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:22,780
How about you just open the portal?

305
00:15:23,980 --> 00:15:24,720
Hey, you too.

306
00:15:24,940 --> 00:15:26,160
I better have all my stuff.

307
00:15:26,480 --> 00:15:27,980
Cold front passing through.

308
00:15:28,420 --> 00:15:30,080
Doorway to the other world open!

309
00:15:33,300 --> 00:15:34,120
It's fine.

310
00:15:34,260 --> 00:15:34,800
Please don't get mad!

311
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:35,440
Everything's fine.

312
00:15:35,540 --> 00:15:37,720
You just don't want anything to do with me!

313
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:41,300
Just like you don't want anything to do with me!

314
00:15:43,300 --> 00:15:45,940
She's way too powerful!

315
00:15:45,940 --> 00:15:47,320
I am perfectly prepared.

316
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:50,140
I am 100% ready for this.

317
00:15:50,460 --> 00:15:50,900
Seiya!

318
00:15:51,520 --> 00:15:53,160
Now is not the time, okay?

319
00:15:57,660 --> 00:16:00,660
You have an ETA for when we'll get to the dragon still?

320
00:16:00,920 --> 00:16:05,000
Well, being a dragon kin lets me sense we're getting closer, so not far now.

321
00:16:06,420 --> 00:16:07,500
Come on!

322
00:16:08,220 --> 00:16:10,160
Whatcha up to back there, eh, Lulu?

323
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:11,660
Just practicing.

324
00:16:11,660 --> 00:16:15,360
If a monster appears, I want to use my magic to help Seiya out.

325
00:16:15,620 --> 00:16:16,860
I don't need your help.

326
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:18,440
You're a baggage handler.

327
00:16:19,020 --> 00:16:20,600
So just handle my baggage.

328
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:22,900
Oh, okay.

329
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:26,060
Have you ever heard the phrase, kid gloves?

330
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:27,680
An orc!

331
00:16:28,140 --> 00:16:28,620
Nice!

332
00:16:28,860 --> 00:16:30,680
The chance to put all my training to the test!

333
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:31,380
Huh?

334
00:16:33,580 --> 00:16:34,060
Oh!

335
00:16:34,260 --> 00:16:35,840
The big bird came out of nowhere!

336
00:16:36,160 --> 00:16:37,960
It literally beat me to the punch.

337
00:16:38,180 --> 00:16:39,940
That is my automatic phoenix.

338
00:16:39,940 --> 00:16:40,820
Meh.

339
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:46,120
This thing detects any monster within a 50-meter radius and automatically attacks it on sight.

340
00:16:46,360 --> 00:16:49,160
Oh, that sounds like some stellar remote fire magic.

341
00:16:49,360 --> 00:16:50,880
Yeah, leave it to you, master.

342
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:53,640
But I wouldn't mind taking out the next enemy.

343
00:16:53,840 --> 00:16:54,100
Whoa!

344
00:16:54,340 --> 00:16:54,920
Watch out!

345
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:56,080
Here comes a tree goblet!

346
00:16:56,140 --> 00:16:56,360
Sweet!

347
00:16:59,780 --> 00:17:00,680
Take that!

348
00:17:00,940 --> 00:17:01,820
Fire arrow!

349
00:17:03,340 --> 00:17:03,780
Rude!

350
00:17:03,780 --> 00:17:08,260
Everything level 30 and under is killed instantly.

351
00:17:08,800 --> 00:17:10,120
We can win without fighting.

352
00:17:10,660 --> 00:17:12,360
There's no greater strategy than that.

353
00:17:12,700 --> 00:17:15,980
He could at least let the kiddos feel like they're doing something useful.

354
00:17:16,540 --> 00:17:19,940
But it's kind of comforting to know he's got another special skill under his belt.

355
00:17:20,540 --> 00:17:20,900
Hmm.

356
00:17:21,420 --> 00:17:23,820
That's the most obvious fake-out I've ever seen.

357
00:17:24,080 --> 00:17:26,100
Nothing a little willpower can't change.

358
00:17:26,100 --> 00:17:30,720
Time to unleash my amazing mega-miss power!

359
00:17:34,660 --> 00:17:35,100
Huh?

360
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:36,400
What the heck is happening?

361
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:39,980
We're kind of cute in a weird way.

362
00:17:42,980 --> 00:17:43,420
Hey!

363
00:17:44,280 --> 00:17:45,520
Pull yourself together, Rista!

364
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:47,340
You're the absolute worst!

365
00:17:47,560 --> 00:17:50,540
I thought you would have learned by now, but I'm not one to bro-and-tell.

366
00:17:51,020 --> 00:17:53,460
Well, it's done like that again, and I'll destroy your head.

367
00:17:53,460 --> 00:17:55,480
You do know we're on the same side, right?

368
00:17:56,180 --> 00:17:59,080
Oh, you better not sneak a peek for a while.

369
00:18:01,180 --> 00:18:02,340
Come on in!

370
00:18:02,780 --> 00:18:04,680
We welcome you to Isalee Village.

371
00:18:05,520 --> 00:18:06,780
Ah! Throttle back, Turbo!

372
00:18:07,220 --> 00:18:08,780
They're just harmless dwarves.

373
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:12,500
They're classified as monsters, but most actually leave peaceful lives.

374
00:18:13,420 --> 00:18:15,140
You sell torches, Bilbro Baggins?

375
00:18:15,300 --> 00:18:17,040
Yes, we certainly do.

376
00:18:17,620 --> 00:18:19,980
Are you going out to the dragon den, stranger?

377
00:18:20,260 --> 00:18:21,300
So you've heard of it.

378
00:18:21,300 --> 00:18:26,180
It's in the rocks out east, but the only thing you'll come across is a dead end.

379
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:27,060
That's it!

380
00:18:27,300 --> 00:18:30,260
The entrance is sealed, but I bet a Lulu and I can fix that.

381
00:18:30,620 --> 00:18:32,340
Hey, I've got a pop quiz for you.

382
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:34,360
How many torches will we need?

383
00:18:34,600 --> 00:18:36,380
Hmm, 50 of them!

384
00:18:36,640 --> 00:18:39,760
He's changed this poor boy's mind and corrupted his common sense.

385
00:18:39,940 --> 00:18:40,380
Wrong.

386
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:42,400
We'll need 500 minimum.

387
00:18:42,420 --> 00:18:43,460
They meant to say five!

388
00:18:43,460 --> 00:18:47,220
She doesn't have any risk management skills.

389
00:18:48,180 --> 00:18:48,940
Hey!

390
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:50,040
Reesey!

391
00:18:50,560 --> 00:18:51,320
Look!

392
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:51,900
Look!

393
00:18:52,180 --> 00:18:53,280
Mine too!

394
00:18:53,780 --> 00:18:54,720
Must be close.

395
00:18:57,220 --> 00:18:58,020
There!

396
00:18:58,020 --> 00:19:10,820
That's it?

397
00:19:11,220 --> 00:19:13,780
Good thing we didn't buy 499 more torches!

398
00:19:14,100 --> 00:19:14,780
Forget that.

399
00:19:15,060 --> 00:19:15,740
Check this.

400
00:19:17,360 --> 00:19:18,400
Okay, Lulu.

401
00:19:18,660 --> 00:19:19,580
Let's do this.

402
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:20,320
Yeah.

403
00:19:20,320 --> 00:19:20,460
Okay.

404
00:19:21,140 --> 00:19:21,420
Huh?

405
00:19:23,120 --> 00:19:25,540
Uh, you good?

406
00:19:25,540 --> 00:19:32,600
I'm lost.

407
00:19:32,720 --> 00:19:33,800
What the crap are you doing?

408
00:19:33,860 --> 00:19:38,460
By making my joints the paragon of flexibility, I'm able to repeat the actions of slicing, thrusting,

409
00:19:38,580 --> 00:19:40,300
and sweeping at incredibly high speed.

410
00:19:40,520 --> 00:19:43,960
This is the Eternal Sword, the chained attack blade!

411
00:19:50,180 --> 00:19:52,640
Whoa, that attack demolished the seal!

412
00:19:52,920 --> 00:19:55,340
I guess we really are useless after all.

413
00:19:55,340 --> 00:19:57,080
No, you shouldn't feel that way.

414
00:19:57,180 --> 00:19:59,840
Without you two, we would have never even found a seal to decimate!

415
00:20:05,520 --> 00:20:06,000
Huh?

416
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:06,960
Okay!

417
00:20:07,440 --> 00:20:09,640
So where's this big bad ultimate weapon hiding?

418
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:13,440
You've done well to come this far.

419
00:20:14,020 --> 00:20:16,120
Welcome fellow descendants of the dragons.

420
00:20:16,180 --> 00:20:16,500
What the?

421
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:19,920
Brave heroes, step into the magic circle.

422
00:20:20,420 --> 00:20:24,600
It shall transport you to Dragon Village, where you will be given Exacean.

423
00:20:24,600 --> 00:20:25,980
Exacean?

424
00:20:26,340 --> 00:20:27,720
Is that how we're saying it?

425
00:20:28,060 --> 00:20:31,220
Time to hop a ride on the glowy platform and get this adventure going!

426
00:20:31,560 --> 00:20:33,640
It's kind of like a homecoming, isn't it, Elulu?

427
00:20:34,100 --> 00:20:36,040
I might just die from the excitement!

428
00:20:36,460 --> 00:20:37,720
Let's not do that, okay?

429
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:45,340
Okay, we're in the circle now.

430
00:20:45,340 --> 00:20:47,020
Excellent!

431
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:49,340
Dragon Village awaits!

432
00:20:49,340 --> 00:21:02,040
Uh, I think there were some technical difficulties.

433
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:03,500
We received a lizard.

434
00:21:04,160 --> 00:21:04,480
Cool.

435
00:21:04,900 --> 00:21:06,380
Nothing abnormal to make note of.

436
00:21:06,720 --> 00:21:08,840
I am confident this is not a trap.

437
00:21:08,840 --> 00:21:17,580
Welcome to Dragon Village.

438
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:17,820
Huh?

439
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:20,260
Your shocked response is only natural.

440
00:21:20,660 --> 00:21:24,820
My people's dragonhood appearance is drastically different from that of the human race.

441
00:21:24,820 --> 00:21:26,800
I am referred to as Lagos.

442
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:31,440
If you would be so kind as to follow me, I shall take you to our leader, Livae.

443
00:21:33,500 --> 00:21:38,040
The village you see before you is a continent located far across the western sea.

444
00:21:39,260 --> 00:21:42,200
Magic circles are the only means humans can travel here.

445
00:21:42,240 --> 00:21:44,680
It seems young Mosh and Elulu have returned!

446
00:21:44,860 --> 00:21:46,920
Mosh looks so dashing now that he's older.

447
00:21:47,280 --> 00:21:49,780
Yes, and Elulu is simply adorable!

448
00:21:49,780 --> 00:21:53,900
Say, if we're originally from here, why do we look so different from everyone else?

449
00:21:54,120 --> 00:21:58,000
We dragon newts came into existence as children of both dragons and humans.

450
00:21:58,460 --> 00:22:02,560
However, the more reptilian-seeming among us have more dragon blood in their veins.

451
00:22:03,320 --> 00:22:06,380
So these guys look human because they got the weaker end of the DNA strand.

452
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:07,480
No.

453
00:22:08,140 --> 00:22:10,200
Mosh and Elulu are choice individuals.

454
00:22:10,800 --> 00:22:13,860
They are dragon kin who shoulder a tremendous destiny.

455
00:22:15,240 --> 00:22:18,240
I'm pleased that both of you have safely returned to us.

456
00:22:18,240 --> 00:22:20,660
Your companions are also welcome.

457
00:22:21,580 --> 00:22:25,720
I am Livae, the reigning monarch and mother of Dragon Village.

458
00:22:26,560 --> 00:22:27,200
Listen well.

459
00:22:27,700 --> 00:22:30,820
The Demon Lord's conquest continues even as we speak.

460
00:22:31,600 --> 00:22:33,740
Although the threat is imminent, you needn't worry.

461
00:22:34,180 --> 00:22:36,840
You dragon kin have chosen the correct place to prepare.

462
00:22:37,620 --> 00:22:39,520
Please step forward, young Mosh.

463
00:22:39,920 --> 00:22:41,300
Me? For real?

464
00:22:41,300 --> 00:22:41,380
Well?

465
00:22:43,780 --> 00:22:47,200
I will show you how to transform into a dragon.

466
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:52,100
There.

467
00:22:56,360 --> 00:22:59,860
By becoming a dragon newt, your abilities have improved considerably.

468
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:02,200
You look cool.

469
00:23:04,380 --> 00:23:05,460
That's amazing.

470
00:23:05,800 --> 00:23:08,100
Your ability ratings literally went up tenfold.

471
00:23:08,320 --> 00:23:08,600
Yeah.

472
00:23:09,000 --> 00:23:10,380
But you better keep your distance.

473
00:23:10,800 --> 00:23:13,240
I can't promise I won't attack since you look like a monster.

474
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:14,920
That's so messed up!

475
00:23:14,960 --> 00:23:15,800
On the plus side.

476
00:23:15,940 --> 00:23:17,460
Now you can carry more of my equipment.

477
00:23:17,700 --> 00:23:18,180
Ugh.

478
00:23:19,920 --> 00:23:24,780
With proper training, you may one day transform from a dragon newt to a dragon god.

479
00:23:24,900 --> 00:23:27,240
Then your skills will reach unparalleled heights.

480
00:23:27,440 --> 00:23:27,760
Yeah!

481
00:23:27,920 --> 00:23:29,240
That sounds good to me!

482
00:23:29,500 --> 00:23:33,780
Um, your majesty, could you maybe show me how to transform too?

483
00:23:33,780 --> 00:23:34,460
But why?

484
00:23:34,580 --> 00:23:36,080
It serves you no purpose.

485
00:23:36,220 --> 00:23:38,900
Oh, if you say so.

486
00:23:38,960 --> 00:23:40,080
Worry not, child.

487
00:23:40,380 --> 00:23:44,120
Your role in this endeavor will prove even greater than that of young Mosh.

488
00:23:44,240 --> 00:23:44,640
Wow!

489
00:23:44,860 --> 00:23:46,060
Do you really mean it?

490
00:23:46,220 --> 00:23:47,120
Yes, my dear.

491
00:23:47,620 --> 00:23:51,240
You are fated to become Exasian, the most powerful of weapons.

492
00:23:51,640 --> 00:23:54,400
You will fulfill this destiny by offering up your life.

493
00:23:54,520 --> 00:23:54,900
Huh?

494
00:23:55,480 --> 00:23:56,860
Like, a sacrifice?

495
00:23:56,860 --> 00:23:58,580
That's not okay.

